Test Cases – Out of Scope Tab Update

TC01 – Verify Out of Scope tab is accessible

Precondition: User is logged in as a SAT System User and has access to Validation View.

Steps:

1. Login to the application.
2. Navigate to Validation View.
3. Open the Out of Scope tab (/rolematrix/validation/all/out/).

Expected Result:

* Out of Scope tab opens successfully.
* Records are displayed without any error.

⸻

TC02 – Verify default Out of Scope description is updated

Precondition: User is on the Out of Scope tab. A record exists where the upload/OIM reason is blank.

Steps:

1. Login to the application.
2. Navigate to Validation View > Out of Scope tab.
3. Find a record where the upload/OIM reason is blank.
4. Check the value displayed in the Out of Scope column.

Expected Result:

* The Out of Scope column displays “No Transfer and Terminations”.

⸻

TC03 – Verify OIM Upload reason is displayed in Out of Scope column

Precondition: User is on the Out of Scope tab. A record exists where the upload/OIM reason is populated.

Steps:

1. Login to the application.
2. Navigate to Validation View > Out of Scope tab.
3. Find a record where the upload/OIM reason has a value.
4. Check the value displayed in the Out of Scope column.

Expected Result:

* The Out of Scope column displays the exact reason from the OIM Upload field.

